{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/RemovedComponents"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/systems\/removedcomponents"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RemovedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","text":"Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The collection holds each entity that lost a "},{"code":"C","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", whether the component was removed or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity despawned, oldest first. The following system scores a point for each entity that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thawed:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["@System","struct CountThawed {","    func run(_ thawed: RemovedComponents<Frozen>, _ score: ResourceWriter<Score>) {","        score.value.points += thawed.count","    }","}","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(Score(points: 0))","let statue = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Frozen())","let frame = Schedule { CountThawed() }","frame.run(on: &world)","","world.remove(Frozen.self, from: statue)","frame.run(on: &world)","print(world.resources[Score.self].points)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The schedule starts recording removals of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/trackRemovals(of:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the system first runs, so removals before then aren’t listed. Removals are kept as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"events are; see "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventReader","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A system parameter that lists the entities that lost a component since the system last read"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them."}],"kind":"symbol","seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"System-Parameters","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/SystemParameter","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/Update","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceReader","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/ResourceWriter","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventReader","doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems\/EventWriter"],"title":"System Parameters"}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RemovedComponents"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Systems\/SystemParameters.swift#L357","fileName":"SystemParameters.swift"},"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RemovedComponents"}],"modules":[{"name":"Systems"}],"title":"RemovedComponents","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:7Systems17RemovedComponentsV"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Systems\/documentation\/Systems"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/